name : agent_uplink_ivsrep
rule : agent_uplink/agent_uplink_ivsrep
---
schema = read(schema);
agent = read(agent);
ts = read(ts);
seq = read(seq);
event_id = read(wp_event_id);
now = Now::time() | Time::to_ts_ms;
dev_ip = read(wp_src_ip);
tenant_id = chars(2092453428448002048);
dev_vendor = read(dev_vendor);
dev_name = read(dev_name);
dev_type = read(dev_type);
log_type = read(log_type);
log_desc = read(log_desc);
// 报告正文保持**原样字符串**（与事实/快照同一口径）：网关按 wist-contracts / 报告自带
// `report_schema` 解析，数据面不做字段建模 —— 否则加一个调查题目就要改一次 WPL/OML。
body = read(body);
